### 9. 自动清理机制 (A: 0分 vs Q: 8分)

```javascript
// ========== 代码 A ==========
// 无自动清理

// ========== 代码 Q ==========
this.autoCleanupDays = 30;

startAutoCleanup() {
    setInterval(() => {
        this.cleanupExpiredItems();
    }, 24 * 60 * 60 * 1000);  // 每天清理
}

cleanupExpiredItems() {
    const cutoffTime = now - (this.autoCleanupDays * 24 * 60 * 60 * 1000);
    this.history = this.history.filter(item => item.timestamp >= cutoffTime);
}
```

